  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p>Total household maintenance time: approximately 2–3 hours per week for a 3BHK Mediterranean-Coastal home. Lower than any other premium style. The materials are inherently forgiving and this shows up as reduced maintenance burden.</p>
